#: boardwidget.cpp:411
msgid "Undo operation done successfully."
msgstr "पहिली जइसन सफलतापूर्वक कर दिस"

#: boardwidget.cpp:415
msgid "What do you want to undo? You have done nothing!"
msgstr "आप के पहिली जइसन करना चाहथो ? आप मन तहां कुछ घलोक नइ करे हे!"

#: boardwidget.cpp:434
msgid "Sorry, you have lost the game."
msgstr "माफ करव, आप मन खेल हार गए"

